{
  "_comment": "Project settings for the rdocx workspace. Local overrides go in .claude/settings.local.json, which is gitignored. The allow-list is the toolchain documented in CLAUDE.md and the command surface in .claude/WORKFLOW.md. The deny-list holds the operations that destroy work irrecoverably, plus the two the workflow reserves for /close-sprint.",
